<title>USA: Alta Gold buys Nevada gold property.</title>
<headline>Alta Gold buys Nevada gold property.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alta Gold Co said Thursday it bought a 1,300-acre gold property in Nevada containing 62 unpatented mining claims.</p>
<p>Alta did not disclose the price it paid for the property, known as Excalibur and located about 130 miles southeast of Reno. It bought the property from an unnamed, private mining company based in Nevada.</p>
<p>Alta said it plans initial drilling on the property in the first quarter of 1997. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
